(7632734, 1237406, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love this.  From the concept to the execution, everything is thought out and well done.  The simple, selective palette is both dramatic and used effectively to support the concept - as are the selective focus and the masterful composition.  My pick for the Blue.</td>', 'I love this.  From the concept to the execution, everything is thought out and well done.  The simple, selective palette is both dramatic and used effectively to support the concept - as are the selective focus and the masterful composition.  My pick for the Blue.', '2019-06-16 11:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7632737, 1237554, 83313, '<td valign="top">This might make a nice print on something unusual, like metallic,</td>', 'This might make a nice print on something unusual, like metallic,', '2019-06-16 12:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7632738, 1237391, 83313, '<td valign="top">Change your expression and it could illustrate inspiration. Good job.</td>', 'Change your expression and it could illustrate inspiration. Good job.', '2019-06-16 12:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7632753, 1237517, 67145, '<td valign="top">this brought tears to my eyes .. and i am having difficulty trying to stop them .. i lost my best friend only a very short time ago .. the grief has been pretty extreme .. seeing this i hope is like a message to me .. that she is happy now .. as i wasnt sure .. having nightmares where she was terrified and in pain .. it was devastating .. <br/>this is very powerful and so emotive .. the old body .. its carried this soul as long as it can .. now its time to release that soul .. <br/>i love that he''s on a road .. the journey leading to something wonderful ..</td>', 'this brought tears to my eyes .. and i am having difficulty trying to stop them .. i lost my best friend only a very short time ago .. the grief has been pretty extreme .. seeing this i hope is like a message to me .. that she is happy now .. as i wasnt sure .. having nightmares where she was terrified and in pain .. it was devastating .. this is very powerful and so emotive .. the old body .. its carried this soul as long as it can .. now its time to release that soul .. i love that he''s on a road .. the journey leading to something wonderful ..', '2019-06-16 17:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7632755, 1237518, 67145, '<td valign="top">quite the statement .. <br/>and if that is the voice in her head then it will be the truth .. <br/>the thing is .. she can leave .. <br/>thats one of the sad facts of life .. we tell ourselves stories that we believe .. but those stories are really only a ''fiction'' .. we have the power to change them .. <br/>the trouble is that we often dont realize that we have that power .. and even finding out that we have the ability to change them  .. it still can be difficult to re-write that story .. <br/>this is depressing real .. and very powerful ..</td>', 'quite the statement .. and if that is the voice in her head then it will be the truth .. the thing is .. she can leave .. thats one of the sad facts of life .. we tell ourselves stories that we believe .. but those stories are really only a ''fiction'' .. we have the power to change them .. the trouble is that we often dont realize that we have that power .. and even finding out that we have the ability to change them  .. it still can be difficult to re-write that story .. this is depressing real .. and very powerful ..', '2019-06-16 17:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7632756, 1237589, 67145, '<td valign="top">awwwwwwww .. looks like a paper wasps nest .. i''m finding this very cute .. i particularly like that one little hatchling coming out of the cell . emerging into the world .. :)</td>', 'awwwwwwww .. looks like a paper wasps nest .. i''m finding this very cute .. i particularly like that one little hatchling coming out of the cell . emerging into the world .. :)', '2019-06-16 17:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
