(7632758, 1237592, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is visually very dramatic and appealing .. in some ways i would have preferred to see one side made less a reflection of the other .. more like a different world rather .. maybe a distorted reflection of one world .. <br/>thats just my opinion .. <br/>i''m pretty sure this will appeal to the voters .. it really has heaps going for it .. the silhouette of that person ... looks like he could be falling .. he''s not going to either side .. but dropping .. i wonder what lurks down there .. good one ...</td>', 'this is visually very dramatic and appealing .. in some ways i would have preferred to see one side made less a reflection of the other .. more like a different world rather .. maybe a distorted reflection of one world .. thats just my opinion .. i''m pretty sure this will appeal to the voters .. it really has heaps going for it .. the silhouette of that person ... looks like he could be falling .. he''s not going to either side .. but dropping .. i wonder what lurks down there .. good one ...', '2019-06-16 17:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
