(7632761, 1237573, 67145, '<td valign="top">its funny how we invest animals with an almost negative connotation .. especially skulls and such .. when in actual fact its us humans who are the ones who operate out of self interest and unconsciously .. <br/>however .. <br/>i really like what you have imagined into being with your photos and your editing skills .. and the message .. <br/>the time factor .. you have only so long to make up your mind .. <br/>but your mind seems to be boxed in .. <br/>what a scary position to be in .. <br/>especially if that negotiation involves your freedom ..</td>', 'its funny how we invest animals with an almost negative connotation .. especially skulls and such .. when in actual fact its us humans who are the ones who operate out of self interest and unconsciously .. however .. i really like what you have imagined into being with your photos and your editing skills .. and the message .. the time factor .. you have only so long to make up your mind .. but your mind seems to be boxed in .. what a scary position to be in .. especially if that negotiation involves your freedom ..', '2019-06-16 18:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7632762, 1237590, 67145, '<td valign="top">oh WOW .. this is BRILLIANT .. <br/>such a statement on how we are so caged in in our own minds .. <br/>loving this so much .. <br/>it would be great if we could open that cage door as easily as we can a bird cage .. <br/>i think the world would be a completely different place .. almost like the end of human suffering .. as its our own minds that create it .</td>', 'oh WOW .. this is BRILLIANT .. such a statement on how we are so caged in in our own minds .. loving this so much .. it would be great if we could open that cage door as easily as we can a bird cage .. i think the world would be a completely different place .. almost like the end of human suffering .. as its our own minds that create it .', '2019-06-16 18:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
